{
  "total": 148,
  "totalPage": 3,
  "page": 1,
  "pageSize": 50,
  "items": [
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b221",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 1,
      "bookHadithIndex": 1,
      "text": "Ibn `Umar narrated that:the Prophet said: \"Salat will not be accepted without purification, nor Charity from Ghulul.\" Hannad said in his narration, \"except with purification\" [Abu `Eisa said: This Hadith is the most correct thing on this topic, and the best. There are also narrations on this topic from Abu Al-Malih, from his father; and Abu Hurairah and Anas. And Abu Al-Malih bin Usamah's name is `Amir, and they also say it was Zaid bin Usamah bin `Umair Al-Hudhali]",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-1-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-1-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-1-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Bukhari And Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b222",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 2,
      "bookHadithIndex": 2,
      "text": "Abu Hurairah narrated that :Allah's Messenger said: \"When a Muslim, or believer, performs Wudu', washing his face, every evil that he looked at with his eyes leaves with the water - or with the last drop of water, or an expression similar to that - and when he washes his hands, every evil he did with his hands leaves with the water - or with the last drop of water - until he becomes free of sin",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-2-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-2-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-2-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-2-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b223",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 3,
      "bookHadithIndex": 3,
      "text": "Ali narrated that :the Prophet, said: \"The key to Salat is the purification, its Tahrlm is the Takblr, and its Tahlil is the Taslim",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-3-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-3-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-3-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-3-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b224",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 4,
      "bookHadithIndex": 4,
      "text": "Jabir bin 'Abdullah, may Allah be pleased with them, narrated that :Allah's Messenger said: \"The key to Paradise is Salat, and the key to Salat is Wudu",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-4-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih Lighairihi"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-4-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-4-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b225",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 5,
      "bookHadithIndex": 5,
      "text": "Anas bin Malik said:\"When the Prophet entered the toilet he would say: 'O Allah Indeed I seek refuge in You.'\" Shu'bah (one of the narrators) said: \"Another time he said: 'I seek refuge in You from AI-Khubthi and al-Khablth.' Or: 'Al-Khubthi and Al-Khaba'ith",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-5-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-5-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-5-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Sahih Bukhari And Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b226",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 6,
      "bookHadithIndex": 6,
      "text": "Anas bin Malik said:\"When the Prophet would enter the toilet 'He said: \"O Allah! Indeed I seek refuge in You from Al-Khubith and Al- Khaba'ith",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-6-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-6-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-6-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-6-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b227",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 7,
      "bookHadithIndex": 7,
      "text": "Aishah, [may Allah be pleased with her] said:\"When the Prophet would exit the toilet he would say: 'Ghufranak",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-7-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-7-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-7-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b228",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 8,
      "bookHadithIndex": 8,
      "text": "Abu Ayyub Al-Ansari narrated that :Allah's Messenger said: \"When one of you arrives to defecate, then let none of you face the Qiblah while defecating, nor while urinating. And do not have your back towards it, but have it east of you or west of you",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-8-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-8-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-8-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b229",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 9,
      "bookHadithIndex": 9,
      "text": "Jabir bin Abdullah said:\"The Prophet prohibited us from facing the Qiblah while urinating. Then i saw him facing it a year before he died",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-9-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-9-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-9-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-9-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b22a",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 10,
      "bookHadithIndex": 10,
      "text": "Abu Qatadah narrated that :he saw the Prophet urinating while facing the Qiblah. Qutaibah narrated that to us, he said: \"Ibn Lahi'ah informed us.\" Jabir's Hadlth about the Prophet is more correct than the Hadith of Ibn Lahi'ah. Ibn Lahi'ah is weak according to the scholars of Hadith. He was graded weak by Yahya bin Sa'eed Al-Qattan, and others, [due to his memorization]",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-10-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Daif Isnaad"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-10-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Daif Isnaad"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-10-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-10-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b22b",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 11,
      "bookHadithIndex": 11,
      "text": "Ibn 'Umar said:\"One day I climbed on Hafsah's house, and I saw the Prophet relieving himself while facing Ash-Sham, with his back toward the Ka'bah",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-11-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-11-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-11-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-11-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b22c",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 12,
      "bookHadithIndex": 12,
      "text": "Aishah said:\"Whoever narrated to you that the Prophet would urinate while standing; then do not believe him. He would not urinate except while squatting.\" [He said:] There are narrations on this topic from Umar, Buraidah, [and Abdur-Rahman bin Hasanah]",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-12-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-12-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-12-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-12-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b22d",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 13,
      "bookHadithIndex": 13,
      "text": "Hudhaifah narrated:\"Allah's Messenger came to a waste area used by people, so he urinated on it while standing. I brought him the (water for) Wudu. Then I left to be away from him, but he called me until I was behind him. So he performed Wudu and wiped (Masaba) over his Khuff",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-13-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-13-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-13-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b22e",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 14,
      "bookHadithIndex": 14,
      "text": "Anas, may Allah Most High be pleased with him, said:\"When the Prophet wanted to relieve himself, he would not raise his garment until he was close to the ground",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-14-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-14-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-14-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b22f",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 15,
      "bookHadithIndex": 15,
      "text": "Abdullah bin Abu Qatadah narrated from his father:\"The Prophet prohibited that a man should touch his penis with his right hand",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-15-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-15-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-15-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-15-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b230",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 16,
      "bookHadithIndex": 16,
      "text": "Abdur-Rahman bin Yazld said, :\"They said to Salman, 'Your Prophet taught you about everything, even defecating?' So Salman said, 'Yes. He prohibited us from facing the Qiblah when defecating and urinating, performing Istinja with the right hand, using less than three stones for Istinja, and using dung or bones for Istinja",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-16-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-16-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-16-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-16-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b231",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 17,
      "bookHadithIndex": 17,
      "text": "Abdullah said:\"Allah's Messenger went out to relieve himself. So he said: 'Bring me tree stones.'\" He said, \"So I came with two stones and a piece of dung. So he took the two stones, and left the dung. He said: 'It is Riks (a degenerative or filthy thing)",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-17-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-17-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-17-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b232",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 18,
      "bookHadithIndex": 18,
      "text": "Abdullah bin Mas'ud narrated that :Allah's Messenger said: \"Do not perform Istinja, with dung, nor with bones. For indeed it is provisions for your brothers among the Jinn",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-18-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-18-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-18-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Bukhari And Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b233",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 19,
      "bookHadithIndex": 19,
      "text": "Aishah said:\"Encourage your Husbands to clean themselves with water, for I am too shy of them, and Allah's Messenger would do that",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-19-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-19-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-19-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-19-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b234",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 20,
      "bookHadithIndex": 20,
      "text": "Al-Mughirah bin Shu'bah said:I was with the Prophet on a journey. The Prophet had to relieve himself, so he went far away",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-20-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-20-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-20-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-20-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b235",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 21,
      "bookHadithIndex": 21,
      "text": "Abdullah bin Mughaffal narrated that :the Prophet prohibited that a man should urinate in his bathing area. And he said: \"It will only cause misgivings.\" [He said:] There are narrations on This topic from \"a man from among the Companions of the Prophet",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-21-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-21-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-21-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-21-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b236",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 22,
      "bookHadithIndex": 22,
      "text": "Abu Hurairah narrated that :Allah's Messenger said: \"If it were not that it would be difficult on my nation, then I would have ordered them to use the Siwak for each prayer",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-22-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-22-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-22-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-22-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b237",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 23,
      "bookHadithIndex": 23,
      "text": "Zaid bin Khalid Al-Juhani said :'I heard Allah's Messenger saying: 'If it were not that it would be difficult on my nation then, I would have ordered them to use the Siwak for each prayer and to delay the Isha prayer until the third of the night.'\"He [Abu Salamah, one of the narrators] said: Zaid bin Khalid wouId attend the prayer in the Masjid and his Siwak would be on his ear in the location of the pen on the ear of a writer. He would not get up to pray without cleaning his teeth, then returning it to its location",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-23-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-23-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-23-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-23-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b238",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 24,
      "bookHadithIndex": 24,
      "text": "Abu Hurairah reported that the :Prophet said: \"When on of you awakens in the night, then let him not put his hand into the vessel until he has poured water on two times, or three times, for indeed he does not know where his hand has spent the night",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-24-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-24-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-24-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-24-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b239",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 25,
      "bookHadithIndex": 25,
      "text": "Rabah bin Abdur-Rahman bin Abi Sufyan bin Huwaitib narrated from his grandmother, from her father; she said (that he said):\"I heard Allah's Messenger saying: there is no Wudu for one who does not mention Allah's Name over it",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-25-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-25-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-25-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-25-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b23a",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 26,
      "bookHadithIndex": 26,
      "text": "Rabah Bin Abdur-Rahman bin Abu Sufyan bin Huwaitib narrated :the same from his grandmother the daughter of Sa'eed bin Zaid, from her father, from the Prophet",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-26-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-26-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b23b",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 27,
      "bookHadithIndex": 27,
      "text": "Salamah bin Qais narrated that :Allah's Messenger said: \"When you perform Wudu then sniff water in the nose and blow it out, and when you use small stones (to remove filth) then make it odd (numbered)",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-27-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-27-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-27-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-27-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b23c",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 28,
      "bookHadithIndex": 28,
      "text": "Abdullah bin Zaid said:\"1 saw the Prophet rinse his mouth and sniff water in his nose using one hand, he did that thrice",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-28-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-28-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-28-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b23d",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 29,
      "bookHadithIndex": 29,
      "text": "Hassan bin Bilal said:\"1 saw Ammar bin Yasir performing Wudu, so he went through his beard (with his hand). It was said to him\" - or he said - \"1 said: 'You go through your beard?' He said: 'And what is there to prevent me? Indeed I saw Allah's Messenger going through his beard",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-29-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-29-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-29-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b23e",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 30,
      "bookHadithIndex": 30,
      "text": "(In another narration) Ammar narrated :the same from the Prophet",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-30-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b23f",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 31,
      "bookHadithIndex": 31,
      "text": "Uthman bin Affan narrated that :the Prophet would go through his beard",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-31-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-31-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-31-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-31-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b240",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 32,
      "bookHadithIndex": 32,
      "text": "Abdullah bin Zaid narrated that:\"Allah's Messenger wiped over his head with his hands, going over the front with them and the rear. He began with the front of his head until they went to the nape of his neck. Then he brought them back again to the place where he began. Then he washed his feet",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-32-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-32-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-32-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b241",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 33,
      "bookHadithIndex": 33,
      "text": "Ar-Rubay' bint Mu'awwidh bin Afra' narrated:\"The Prophet wiped his head two times: He began with the rear of his head, then with the front of his head and with both of his ears, outside and Inside of them",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-33-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-33-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-33-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-33-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b242",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 34,
      "bookHadithIndex": 34,
      "text": "Ar-Rubayy bint Mu'awidh bin Afra narrated that :she saw the Prophet performing Wudu. She said: \"He wiped his head, and what is in the front of it and what is in its rear, and his temples and his ears one time",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-34-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Hasan Isnaad"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-34-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Hasan Isnaad"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-34-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-34-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b243",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 35,
      "bookHadithIndex": 35,
      "text": "Abdullah bin Zaid narrated that :he saw the Prophet performing Wudu, and that he wiped his head with water that was not left over from his hands",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-35-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-35-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-35-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-35-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b244",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 36,
      "bookHadithIndex": 36,
      "text": "Ibn 'Abbas narrated:\"The Prophet wiped his head and his ears: the outside and the inside of them.\" ($ahih)",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-36-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-36-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-36-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-36-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b245",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 37,
      "bookHadithIndex": 37,
      "text": "Abu Umamah narrated:\"The Prophet performed Wudu; so he washed his face three times, and his hands three times, and wiped his head, and he said: \"The ears are part of the head",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-37-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-37-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-37-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b246",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 38,
      "bookHadithIndex": 38,
      "text": "Asim bin Laqit bin Sabirah narrated from his father that :the Prophet Muhammad said: \"When performing Wudu go between the fingers",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-38-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-38-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-38-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-38-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b247",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 39,
      "bookHadithIndex": 39,
      "text": "Ibn Abbas narrated that :Allah's Messenger said: \"When performing Wudu go between the fingers of your hands and (toes of) your feet",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-39-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-39-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-39-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-39-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b248",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 40,
      "bookHadithIndex": 40,
      "text": "Al-Mustawrid bin Shaddad Al-Fihri said :\"I saw the Prophet when he was performing Wudu doing that to the toes on his feet with his pinky",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-40-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-40-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
