      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 44,
      "bookHadithIndex": 44,
      "text": "Ali narrated that:\"The Prophet performed Wudu three times (for each limb)",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-44-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-44-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-44-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b24d",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 45,
      "bookHadithIndex": 45,
      "text": "Thabit bin Abi Safiyyah said, :\"I asked Abu Ja'far: 'Did Jabir narrate to you that: \"The Prophet performed Wudu one time each, and two times, and three times?\" He said: \"Yes",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-45-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-45-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-45-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b24e",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 46,
      "bookHadithIndex": 46,
      "text": "Thabit bin Abi Safiyyah said, :\"1 asked Abu Ja'far: 'Did Jabir narrate to you that: \"The Prophet performed Wudu one time each?\" He said: \"Yes",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-46-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-46-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b24f",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 47,
      "bookHadithIndex": 47,
      "text": "Abdullah bin Zaid narrated that:\"The Prophet performed Wudu. So he washed his face three times, and washed his hands two times each, and wiped his head, and washed his feet [two times]",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-47-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih Isnaad"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-47-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih Isnaad"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-47-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-47-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b250",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 48,
      "bookHadithIndex": 48,
      "text": "Abu Hayyah narrated:\"I saw Ali performing Wudu. He washed his hands until he cleaned them, then he rinsed out his mouth three times, sniffed water into his nose and blew it out three times, washed his face three times, and his forearms three times. He wiped his head once, then he washed his feet up to the ankles. Then he stood up, taking what was left over from his purification (water) and drank it while he was standing. Then he said, 'I wanted to show you how Allah's Messenger purified himself",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-48-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-48-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-48-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b251",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 49,
      "bookHadithIndex": 49,
      "text": "Abd Khair related a narration similar to that of Abu Hayyah, :from Ali (no. 48). Except that Abd Khair's version includes the following additions: \"When he was finished from his purification, he would take what was left over from his purification with his hand to drink it",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-49-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-49-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-49-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-49-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b252",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 50,
      "bookHadithIndex": 50,
      "text": "Abu Hurairah narrated that :the Prophet said: \"Jibril came to me and he said: 'O Muhammad! When you perform wudu then perform Nadh",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-50-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-50-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-1-50-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
